title: SysDVR
iconUri: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/laurorual/sysdvr-webos/main/webos/icon.png
manifestUrl: https://github.com/laurorual/sysdvr-webos/releases/latest/download/io.github.sysdvrwebos.client.manifest.json
category: utility
pool: main
requirements:
  webosRelease: '>=5.0'
description: |
  Native Nintendo Switch streaming client for LG webOS TVs. Supports SysDVR
  TCP Bridge and Switch Frame Tap Network mode with hardware H.264 decoding,
  PCM audio, LAN discovery and automatic reconnect.
